        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.poster.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.webm?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.mp4?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on your high-velocity jumping stilts and clock in at <strong>H.O.E. (Hot Organ Express)</strong> - the only delivery service crazy enough to move beating hearts by birdman. Your mission is simple: pick up transplant organs, tear across a soaring sci-fi city, and drop the goods before they flatline. Nail deliveries to earn cash and gain extra time - then crank the difficulty for even wilder runs and bigger payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe with easy jobs or risk it all on brutal, split-second routes. Either way, momentum is everything: pump your jump charge, ride gravity’s pull, and keep your combo alive by chaining rooftop after rooftop. Crash at full tilt and you’ll rag-doll down to street level - unless you can scramble onto a dumpster boost and vault straight back into the skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/6430ce2d880bcbbf589376b0b9517f7e.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump-only locomotion:</strong> Chain stilt-boosted leaps for breakneck speed and pure, arcade airtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three route tiers:</strong> Easy, medium, hard. Tougher orders give shorter deadlines but higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical playground:</strong> Jump from rooftop to rooftop on skyscrapers, through parks, beaches, and even flying cars.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-versus-reward:</strong> Every collision is chaos - master the tilt to stay fluid, or faceplant and lose precious seconds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-run ready:</strong> Tight five-minute loops and instant restarts, built for optimization addicts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.poster.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.webm?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.mp4?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.poster.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.webm?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.mp4?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on your high-velocity jumping stilts and clock in at <strong>H.O.E. (Hot Organ Express)</strong> - the only delivery service crazy enough to move beating hearts by birdman. Your mission is simple: pick up transplant organs, tear across a soaring sci-fi city, and drop the goods before they flatline. Nail deliveries to earn cash and gain extra time - then crank the difficulty for even wilder runs and bigger payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe with easy jobs or risk it all on brutal, split-second routes. Either way, momentum is everything: pump your jump charge, ride gravity’s pull, and keep your combo alive by chaining rooftop after rooftop. Crash at full tilt and you’ll rag-doll down to street level - unless you can scramble onto a dumpster boost and vault straight back into the skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/6430ce2d880bcbbf589376b0b9517f7e.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump-only locomotion:</strong> Chain stilt-boosted leaps for breakneck speed and pure, arcade airtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three route tiers:</strong> Easy, medium, hard. Tougher orders give shorter deadlines but higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical playground:</strong> Jump from rooftop to rooftop on skyscrapers, through parks, beaches, and even flying cars.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-versus-reward:</strong> Every collision is chaos - master the tilt to stay fluid, or faceplant and lose precious seconds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-run ready:</strong> Tight five-minute loops and instant restarts, built for optimization addicts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.poster.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.webm?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.mp4?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
